msgstr "surveyexample"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:101
#: 4bc8846fc64749eb9a48fa0b68bf0352
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* will then display a configuration screen where you can "
"define the camera make/model and other parameters including the overlap you "
"want between pictures, lens size, etc. ``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` is "
"automatically calculated based on this information!"
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner* 将显示配置界面，可定义相机品牌/型号及其他参数，包括照片重叠率、镜头尺寸等。 "
"``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` 将根据这些信息自动计算！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:107
#: 0e3cbc2fee9b479bb21bc77fea36a08e
msgid "|surveyexample2|"
msgstr "|surveyexample2|"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst
#: a4ba957dbe7e4d5ca534ebdd824f20e9
msgid "surveyexample2"
